      "content": "hey so im T1D and i just accidentally ate like a massive bowl of pasta... maybe like 120g of carbs. i was trying to figure out my correction but im confused. my doctor said my ratio is 1 unit for every 5g but i also have this other note saying i need to dose my correction at a 1:10 ratio for the extra stuff. so if i want to cover the 120g and use the 1:10 ratio for the meal part... how many units of rapid insulin should i take right now?? i dont want to go too high",
